  "text": "IR | unerry, Inc. コーポレートサイトへ IR情報 Japanese コーポレートサイトへ unerry IR TOP Investor Relations (English) Investor Relations Pioneering the Future with Real-World Behavioral Data: Making Everyday Life More \"unerry\" Our mission in this era of information overload is clear: \"Creating a comfortable future with data.\" We achieve this by bridging the digital and physical realms, leveraging our proprietary pool of data covering over 850 million IDs. Our goal is to realize \"Ambient Intelligence\"—environments that intuitively support human activity, creating new value and driving sustainable growth. We sincerely appreciate your support thus far and ask for your continued expectations in the future. Founder/CEO Hidetoshi Uchiyama For inquiries, please click here to contact us. Pick up Presentation Material for Full-Year Ending June 2026 Financial Results（7MB） Summary of Consolidated Financial Results for the Fiscal Year Ended June 30, 2026 (Under Japanese GAAP)（203KB） Transcript of Financial Results Briefing for the Fiscal Year Ending June 30, 2026（6MB） IR contents (All) 2026.10.07 [Delayed] Business Plan and Growth Potential Presentation Materials（5MB） 2026.09.04 Notice Concerning Results of Treasury Share Acquisition through Off-Auction Own Share Repurchase Trading (ToSTNeT-3) and Completion of Acquisition（356KB） 2026.09.03 Notice Concerning Acquisition of Treasury Shares and Purchase of Own Shares through Off-Auction Own Share Repurchase Trading (ToSTNeT-3)（358KB） 2026.08.14 Transcript of Financial Results Briefing for the Fiscal Year Ending June 30, 2026（6MB） 2026.08.13 Presentation Material for Full-Year Ending June 2026 Financial Results（7MB） 2026.08.13 Summary of Consolidated Financial Results for the Fiscal Year Ended June 30, 2026 (Under Japanese GAAP)（203KB） 2026.08.13 Notice Concerning Commencement of Preparations for Absorption-Type Merger with Wholly Owned Subsidiary (Blogwatcher Inc.)（284KB） 2026.07.31 Notice Concerning Revision of Earnings Forecasts fo